    "Grapes": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cépages"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grid": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grille"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grid rack": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Casier classique"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Group wines your own way (gift, birth year, for a friend) in the **Tags** of a wine. The Cellar shows a chip for each tag under the styles: tap it to see only those wines. Search finds tags too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Regroupez les vins à votre façon (cadeau, année de naissance, pour un ami) dans les **Tags** d’un vin. La Cave affiche une pastille par tag sous les styles : touchez-la pour ne voir que ces vins. La recherche trouve aussi les tags."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Half bottle": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Demi-bouteille"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Half bottle 37.5 cl, bottle 75 cl, magnum 1.5 l, double magnum 3 l.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Demi-bouteille 37,5 cl, bouteille 75 cl, magnum 1,5 l, double magnum 3 l."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Help": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aide"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Help with adding bottles": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aide pour ajouter des bouteilles"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Help with devices": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aide sur les appareils"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Help with discoveries": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aide sur les découvertes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Help with racks": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aide sur les casiers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Help with tasting notes": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aide sur les notes de dégustation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Holds %lld bottles.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Contient %lld bouteilles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Holds %lld bottles. Places are named by row letter and number, like B3; B3-2 is the second bottle in a cell.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Contient %lld bouteilles. Les emplacements sont nommés par lettre de rangée et numéro, comme B3 ; B3-2 est la deuxième bouteille d’une case."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Honeycomb rack": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Casier nid d’abeille"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long the flavors last after swallowing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Combien de temps les saveurs persistent après avoir avalé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many bottles fit one behind the other on a shelf.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Combien de bouteilles tiennent l’une derrière l’autre sur une clayette."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many identical bottles you add.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Combien de bouteilles identiques vous ajoutez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How to Run a Relay": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Héberger un relais"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How to set up AI": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comment configurer l’IA"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How was it?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C’était comment ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ideas": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Idées"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If an AI service is set up in Settings, the label photo is also sent to it to complete the style, region, grapes and drinking window. Only that photo is sent, never your cellar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si un service d’IA est configuré dans les réglages, la photo de l’étiquette lui est aussi envoyée pour compléter le type, la région, les cépages et la fenêtre de dégustation. Seule cette photo est envoyée, jamais votre cave."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Importer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Imported %lld bottles of %lld new wines.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld bouteilles importées, dont %2$lld nouveaux vins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Importer…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In **Settings → AI**, choose a provider. You need an account with it and an API key; the provider bills you directly for what you use, usually a fraction of a cent per label.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans **Réglages → IA**, choisissez un fournisseur. Il vous faut un compte chez lui et une clé d’API ; le fournisseur vous facture directement ce que vous utilisez, en général une fraction de centime par étiquette."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In **Settings**, load the sample cellar to explore every screen, then erase it when you are ready to add your own bottles.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans les **Réglages**, chargez la cave d’exemple pour découvrir chaque écran, puis effacez-la quand vous êtes prêt à ajouter vos bouteilles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In LM Studio, load a vision model and start the server; turn on “Serve on Local Network” to use it from iPhone or iPad.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans LM Studio, chargez un modèle de vision et démarrez le serveur ; activez « Serve on Local Network » pour l’utiliser depuis l’iPhone ou l’iPad."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the Cellar list (not the table), choose **Select Wines** in the sort menu, tick the wines, then place them in a rack, take them out of their places or delete them. **Undo** puts everything back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans la liste de la Cave (pas le tableau), choisissez **Sélectionner des vins** dans le menu de tri, cochez les vins, puis rangez-les dans un casier, sortez-les de leur emplacement ou supprimez-les. **Annuler** remet tout en place."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Insights": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Statistiques"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install Ollama": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installer Ollama"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install a local server (Ollama)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installer un serveur local (Ollama)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install a model that reads images, for example: ollama pull gemma3. To use it from iPhone or iPad, start Ollama with OLLAMA_HOST=0.0.0.0 on the computer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installez un modèle qui lit les images, par exemple : ollama pull gemma3. Pour l’utiliser depuis l’iPhone ou l’iPad, lancez Ollama avec OLLAMA_HOST=0.0.0.0 sur l’ordinateur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inventory for Printing (PDF)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inventaire à imprimer (PDF)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Irregular racks": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Casiers irréguliers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It appears first among the filters, one tap away.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elle apparaît en premier parmi les filtres, à portée d’un toucher."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It keeps what it already has, but can no longer sync with your other devices.": {
      "localizations": {
