    },
    "Stop Syncing on This Device": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrêter la synchronisation sur cet appareil"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop syncing on this device?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrêter la synchronisation sur cet appareil ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Storage": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stockage"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Style": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Style"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Style and origin": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Type et origine"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suggested": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suggérée"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suggestions": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suggestions"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suggests bottles from your cellar that are at their best, the most urgent first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suggère des bouteilles de votre cave à leur apogée, les plus urgentes d’abord."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swipe a device in the list and choose **Remove**, or on the Mac, right-click it and choose **Remove Device**. It keeps what it already has but can no longer sync with your devices: each device proves it belongs to the cellar with its own key, and the removed one's key is no longer accepted. To use it with your cellar again later, choose **Stop Syncing** on it, then add it as a new device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Balayez un appareil dans la liste et choisissez **Retirer**, ou sur le Mac, faites un clic droit dessus et choisissez **Retirer l’appareil**. Il garde ce qu’il a déjà mais ne peut plus se synchroniser avec vos appareils : chaque appareil prouve qu’il fait partie de la cave avec sa propre clé, et celle de l’appareil retiré n’est plus acceptée. Pour le réutiliser plus tard avec votre cave, choisissez **Arrêter la synchronisation** sur cet appareil, puis ajoutez-le comme un nouvel appareil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swipe a wine to the right, or use **Drink** on its page. The bottle leaves the cellar and its place in the rack becomes free. **Undo** appears for a few seconds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Balayez un vin vers la droite, ou utilisez **Boire** sur sa fiche. La bouteille quitte la cave et sa place dans le casier se libère. **Annuler** reste affiché quelques secondes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sync Away from Home": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Synchroniser loin de la maison"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sync Now": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Synchroniser"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sync between your devices and with the people you share a cellar with will be end-to-end encrypted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La synchronisation entre vos appareils et avec les personnes avec qui vous partagez une cave sera chiffrée de bout en bout."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sync between your devices is encrypted from end to end. On the same Wi-Fi they talk directly; through iCloud or a relay, only encrypted files are stored, and nobody else can read them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La synchronisation entre vos appareils est chiffrée de bout en bout. Sur le même Wi-Fi, ils communiquent directement ; via iCloud ou un relais, seuls des fichiers chiffrés sont stockés, et personne d’autre ne peut les lire."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sync could not start on this network.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La synchronisation n’a pas pu démarrer sur ce réseau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sync your cellar with your iPhone, iPad and Mac, encrypted from end to end.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Synchronisez votre cave entre iPhone, iPad et Mac, chiffrée de bout en bout."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Synced %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Synchronisé %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Syncing": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Synchronisation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Syncing…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Synchronisation…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Table": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tableau"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tags": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tags"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tags group discoveries your way: gift ideas, for summer, to try again. Tap a tag to select it, or type a new one; tags you used before are suggested.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les tags regroupent vos découvertes à votre façon : idées cadeaux, pour l’été, à regoûter. Touchez un tag pour le choisir ou tapez-en un nouveau ; ceux déjà utilisés sont proposés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take Out of Racks": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sortir des casiers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take Them Out of the Rack": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les sortir du casier"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Taken out, they stay in the cellar without a place. Gone, they leave the cellar (given away, drunk elsewhere, broken). You can undo right after.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sorties, elles restent dans la cave sans emplacement. Parties, elles quittent la cave (offertes, bues ailleurs, cassées). Vous pouvez annuler juste après."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap **Check Key and Load Models**: the app asks the provider which models your key can use and fills the model menu. Choose a model that reads images.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touchez **Vérifier la clé et charger les modèles** : l’app demande au fournisseur les modèles accessibles avec votre clé et remplit le menu. Choisissez un modèle qui lit les images."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a bottle, then **Move**, then the new place. A place with room takes the bottle; in racks with one bottle per place, tapping another bottle swaps them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touchez une bouteille, puis **Déplacer**, puis le nouvel emplacement. Un emplacement qui a de la place prend la bouteille ; dans les casiers à une bouteille par emplacement, toucher une autre bouteille les échange."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a place in the rack to add a bottle there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touchez un emplacement du casier pour y ajouter une bouteille."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a place. Tapping another bottle swaps them; a bin takes the bottle if it has room.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touchez un emplacement. Toucher une autre bouteille les échange ; un casier prend la bouteille s’il a de la place."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a position. Tapping another bottle swaps them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touchez un emplacement. Toucher une autre bouteille les échange."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap each bottle you find in the rack.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touchez chaque bouteille que vous trouvez dans le casier."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the new position": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touchez le nouvel emplacement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap where to put %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touchez où mettre %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Taste and structure: sweetness, acidity, tannins, body.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Goût et structure : sucrosité, acidité, tanins, corps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tasting": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dégustation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tasting Note": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Note de dégustation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tasting event": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Salon, dégustation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tastings": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dégustations"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temperature": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Température"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test data": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Données de test"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That position is already taken.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cet emplacement est déjà occupé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That position is outside the rack.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cet emplacement est hors du casier."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI service returned error %lld.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le service d’IA a renvoyé l’erreur %lld."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI service that reads label photos. You need an account and an API key with it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le service d’IA qui lit les photos d’étiquettes. Il vous faut un compte et une clé d’API chez lui."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The answer from the AI service could not be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La réponse du service d’IA est illisible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bottle stays in its place but is no longer suggested for tonight.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La bouteille reste à sa place mais n’est plus proposée pour ce soir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bottles you opened with your notes, the wines you discovered elsewhere, your shopping list and insights.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les bouteilles ouvertes avec vos notes, les vins découverts ailleurs, votre liste d’achats et vos statistiques."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cellar is larger than this relay accepts in one file. Use a relay with a higher limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La cave dépasse la taille de fichier acceptée par ce relais. Utilisez un relais avec une limite plus haute."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cellar stays on this device as it is. Other devices keep syncing together.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La cave reste telle quelle sur cet appareil. Les autres appareils continuent de se synchroniser entre eux."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The change could not be saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La modification n’a pas pu être enregistrée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The code expired. Show a new code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le code a expiré. Affichez un nouveau code."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The codes were not confirmed on both devices. Nothing was shared.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les codes n’ont pas été confirmés sur les deux appareils. Rien n’a été partagé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection was lost. Try again with a new code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La connexion a été perdue. Réessayez avec un nouveau code."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The estate, domaine or house that made the wine.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le château, le domaine ou la maison qui a produit le vin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file could not be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le fichier n’a pas pu être lu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first free positions are used unless you choose them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les premiers emplacements libres sont utilisés, sauf si vous les choisissez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first free positions are used unless you choose them. Tap Positions to pick them on the rack.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les premiers emplacements libres sont utilisés, sauf si vous les choisissez. Touchez Emplacements pour les choisir sur le casier."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The four sections and how they work together.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les quatre sections et comment elles fonctionnent ensemble."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The glass in the menu bar lists the bottles to open now and where they are; click one to open it. Turn it off in **Settings**.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le verre dans la barre des menus liste les bouteilles à ouvrir maintenant et leur emplacement ; cliquez sur l’une d’elles pour l’ouvrir. Désactivez-le dans les **Réglages**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The harvest year on the label. Non-vintage for wines without a year.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’année de récolte sur l’étiquette. Non millésimé pour les vins sans année."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The label photo is kept with the wine, resized and without location data. You can change or remove it when editing the wine.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La photo de l’étiquette est gardée avec le vin, redimensionnée et sans données de localisation. Vous pouvez la changer ou la supprimer en modifiant le vin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The last sync did not finish. It will try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La dernière synchronisation n’a pas abouti. Elle sera retentée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model declined to read this photo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le modèle a refusé de lire cette photo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The name on the label, without the vintage. Required.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le nom sur l’étiquette, sans le millésime. Obligatoire."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The other device could not be verified. Nothing was shared. Try again with a new code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’autre appareil n’a pas pu être vérifié. Rien n’a été partagé. Réessayez avec un nouveau code."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The other device runs a different version of Encave. Update both devices.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’autre appareil utilise une version différente d’Encave. Mettez les deux à jour."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The photo": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La photo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The price on the wine list or in the shop, to compare when you buy it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le prix sur la carte ou chez le caviste, pour comparer au moment de l’acheter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The protected name of origin, such as Pauillac or Chablis.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’appellation d’origine, comme Pauillac ou Chablis."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The relay cannot be reached. Syncing will resume when it can.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le relais est injoignable. La synchronisation reprendra dès que possible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The relay is full. Remove old photos or use another relay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le relais est plein. Supprimez d’anciennes photos ou utilisez un autre relais."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The relay only ever receives encrypted files. It cannot see your wines, photos or device names.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le relais ne reçoit que des fichiers chiffrés. Il ne peut voir ni vos vins, ni vos photos, ni le nom de vos appareils."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The relay refused this device. Check the relay address.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le relais a refusé cet appareil. Vérifiez l’adresse du relais."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The removed device could not be shut out of syncing away from home yet. It will be tried again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’appareil retiré n’a pas encore pu être exclu de la synchronisation à distance. Ce sera retenté."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same cellar on your iPhone, iPad and Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La même cave sur votre iPhone, iPad et Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The storage cannot be reached. Syncing will resume when it can.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le stockage est injoignable. La synchronisation reprendra dès que possible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The storage sees when devices sync, how much they send and, for a relay, their IP addresses.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le stockage voit quand les appareils se synchronisent, combien ils envoient et, pour un relais, leurs adresses IP."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The style (red, white, sparkling…) is used for colors, serving temperature and food pairing. The appellation, region, country and grapes make search and pairing better.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le type (rouge, blanc, effervescent…) sert aux couleurs, à la température de service et aux accords. L’appellation, la région, le pays et les cépages améliorent la recherche et les accords."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The text is read on this device to fill in the name, producer and vintage.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le texte est lu sur cet appareil pour remplir le nom, le producteur et le millésime."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The wine region, such as Bordeaux or Tuscany.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La région viticole, comme Bordeaux ou la Toscane."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The years entered for this wine.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les années saisies pour ce vin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The years when the wine is at its best, from the producer or a guide. Used by Tonight to suggest what to open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les années où le vin est à son meilleur, d’après le producteur ou un guide. Utilisé par Ce soir pour suggérer quoi ouvrir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The years when the wine is at its best. With **Estimate automatically**, it is worked out from the style and the vintage; turn it off to enter the years from the producer or a guide.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les années où le vin est à son meilleur. Avec **Estimer automatiquement**, elles sont déduites du type et du millésime ; désactivez-le pour saisir les années du producteur ou d’un guide."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their bottles and tastings are deleted too. You can undo right after.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leurs bouteilles et dégustations sont aussi supprimées. Vous pouvez annuler juste après."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They Match": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ils sont identiques"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thinking…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réflexion…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This address does not answer as an Encave relay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette adresse ne répond pas comme un relais Encave."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This bottle has already been opened.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette bouteille a déjà été ouverte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This bottle is on order: mark it received first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette bouteille est en commande : marquez-la d’abord comme reçue."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cet appareil"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device already has bottles": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cet appareil a déjà des bouteilles"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device could not wait for the other one on the network.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cet appareil n’a pas pu attendre l’autre sur le réseau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device only": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cet appareil seulement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device was removed from the cellar on another device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cet appareil a été retiré de la cave depuis un autre appareil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device will show only the other device’s cellar. Make a backup first if you may need these bottles.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cet appareil n’affichera que la cave de l’autre appareil. Faites d’abord une sauvegarde si vous pourriez avoir besoin de ces bouteilles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device’s bottles": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bouteilles de cet appareil"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file is not an Encave backup or a CSV with a name column.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce fichier n’est ni une sauvegarde Encave, ni un CSV avec une colonne « name »."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This item no longer exists.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cet élément n’existe plus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This makes sure no one else is in between. Different codes: answer No and start again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cela garantit que personne ne s’est glissé entre les deux. Codes différents : répondez Non et recommencez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This place is full.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cet emplacement est plein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This question cannot be answered. Try asking about a dish or an occasion.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette question ne peut pas recevoir de réponse. Essayez avec un plat ou une occasion."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes every bottle, rack and tasting from this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cela supprime toutes les bouteilles, tous les casiers et toutes les dégustations de cet appareil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To buy": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À acheter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To drink this year: %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À boire cette année : %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To sync when your devices are not on the same Wi-Fi, open **Devices › Sync Away from Home**. Choose **Use iCloud** if it is offered (for devices on the same Apple Account), or enter the address of a relay: a small open-source service that only stores encrypted files. You can run your own (instructions in the link on that page) or use one run by someone you trust. The other devices receive the setting the next time they meet on the same Wi-Fi, or when you enter the same relay on them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour synchroniser quand vos appareils ne sont pas sur le même Wi-Fi, ouvrez **Appareils › Synchroniser loin de la maison**. Choisissez **Utiliser iCloud** si l’option est proposée (pour les appareils connectés au même compte Apple), ou saisissez l’adresse d’un relais : un petit service open source qui ne stocke que des fichiers chiffrés. Vous pouvez héberger le vôtre (instructions dans le lien de cette page) ou utiliser celui d’une personne de confiance. Les autres appareils reçoivent le réglage la prochaine fois qu’ils se retrouvent sur le même Wi-Fi, ou quand vous y saisissez le même relais."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aujourd’hui"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tonight": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce soir"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tonight and drinking windows": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce soir et fenêtres de dégustation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tonight shows the bottles to drink soon first. Choose a dish to see the wines from your cellar that go with it, and why.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce soir montre d’abord les bouteilles à boire bientôt. Choisissez un plat pour voir les vins de votre cave qui s’y accordent, et pourquoi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tonight, open %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce soir, ouvrez %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tonight, open…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce soir, ouvrez…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Travel": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voyage"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try Again": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réessayer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try it": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Essayer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn Off": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactiver"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on **Monthly Reminder** in Settings: on the first of each month, a notification tells you how many bottles to drink this year, which have just become ready and which are past their peak. It is worked out on this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activez **Rappel mensuel** dans les réglages : le premier de chaque mois, une notification indique combien de bouteilles boire cette année, lesquelles viennent d’être prêtes et lesquelles ont passé leur apogée. C’est calculé sur cet appareil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on **Reminders** in Settings: on the first of each month, a notification tells you how many bottles to drink this year, which have just become ready and which are past their peak, and another comes on the day bottles on order are expected. It is worked out on this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activez **Rappels** dans les réglages : le premier de chaque mois, une notification indique combien de bouteilles boire cette année, lesquelles viennent d’être prêtes et lesquelles ont passé leur apogée, et une autre arrive le jour où des bouteilles en commande sont attendues. C’est calculé sur cet appareil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on **Rows of different lengths** for a rack under a sloped ceiling or a staircase, and set the length of each row.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activez **Rangées de longueurs différentes** pour un casier sous pente ou sous un escalier, et réglez la longueur de chaque rangée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on **To buy** to add the wine to your shopping list, with the price you saw. When you buy it, swipe it and choose **Add to Cellar**: it leaves the list once the bottles are added.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activez **À acheter** pour mettre le vin sur votre liste d’achats, avec le prix vu. Quand vous l’achetez, balayez-le et choisissez **Ajouter à la cave** : il quitte la liste une fois les bouteilles ajoutées."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two, one behind the other": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deux, l’une derrière l’autre"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type a few letters of the name to add bottles of a wine you already have.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapez quelques lettres du nom pour ajouter des bouteilles d’un vin que vous avez déjà."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Under the gauge, each wine says where its window comes from: estimated from the style and the vintage, or entered by you. **Drink Sooner** and **Keep Longer** move its end by a year.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sous la jauge, chaque vin indique d’où vient sa fenêtre : estimée d’après le style et le millésime, ou saisie par vous. **Boire plus tôt** et **Garder plus longtemps** déplacent sa fin d’un an."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Under the stairs": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sous l’escalier"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undo": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Annuler"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unknown": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inconnue"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unknown wine": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vin inconnu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Until": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use **Given away or broken** for a bottle that left the cellar without being drunk by you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilisez **Donnée ou cassée** pour une bouteille sortie de la cave sans que vous l’ayez bue."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use This Label": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utiliser cette étiquette"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use This Wine": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utiliser ce vin"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use iCloud": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utiliser iCloud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use this if the bottle was logged by mistake.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À utiliser si la bouteille a été notée par erreur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use your own AI service for label recognition.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilisez votre propre service d’IA pour reconnaître les étiquettes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Used by Tonight to suggest what to open. You can adjust it anytime.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sert à « Ce soir » pour suggérer quoi ouvrir. Modifiable à tout moment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Used for colors, serving temperature, the estimated drinking window and food pairing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sert aux couleurs, à la température de service, à la fenêtre de dégustation estimée et aux accords."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Used for new purchases. Prices already entered keep their currency.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilisée pour les nouveaux achats. Les prix déjà saisis gardent leur devise."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Used for the value of your cellar in Insights. The currency is set in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sert à la valeur de votre cave dans les Statistiques. La devise se règle dans les réglages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Valid for 2 minutes, for one device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Valable 2 minutes, pour un seul appareil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vegetarian": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Végétarien"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Very fresh, perfect with the cheese platter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Très frais, parfait avec le plateau de fromages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "View": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Affichage"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vintage": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Millésime"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for the other device": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En attente de l’autre appareil"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for the other device…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En attente de l’autre appareil…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What goes with roast chicken tonight?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qu’est-ce qui va avec un poulet rôti ce soir ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is sent": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce qui est envoyé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What to Open Tonight": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Que boire ce soir"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What to open now: bottles at their peak or to drink soon first, and ideas to match a dish.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quoi ouvrir maintenant : d’abord les bouteilles à leur apogée ou à boire bientôt, et des idées selon le plat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you ate with it, to remember good pairings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que vous avez mangé avec, pour retenir les bons accords."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you liked, the dish, the moment…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce qui vous a plu, le plat, le moment…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you typed stays": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que vous avez saisi reste"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When each wine is at its best.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand chaque vin est à son meilleur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When joining, choose **Combine** to put both cellars together, or **Replace** to keep only the other device's cellar (for example after trying the sample cellar).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En rejoignant, choisissez **Réunir** pour mettre les deux caves ensemble, ou **Remplacer** pour ne garder que la cave de l’autre appareil (par exemple après avoir essayé la cave d’exemple)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When to drink": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand boire"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Où"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where is it?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Où est-elle ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where you had it, to find the wine again later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Où vous l’avez bu, pour retrouver le vin plus tard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While you scan, the camera also reads the bottle's barcode and keeps it with the wine. The next time you scan a bottle of that wine, **Already in your cellar** appears: tap **Use This Wine** to add bottles without filling anything in. Barcodes are matched on this device only; Encave looks nothing up online.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pendant le scan, l’appareil photo lit aussi le code-barres de la bouteille et le garde avec le vin. La prochaine fois que vous scannez une bouteille de ce vin, **Déjà dans votre cave** apparaît : touchez **Utiliser ce vin** pour ajouter des bouteilles sans rien remplir. Les codes-barres sont reconnus sur cet appareil uniquement ; Encave ne cherche rien en ligne."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "White": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Blanc"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who gave you the bottle.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qui vous a offert la bouteille."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Why this window": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pourquoi cette fenêtre"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Windows ending each year": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fins de fenêtre par année"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wine": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vin"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wine Page": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fiche du vin"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wine fridge": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cave à vin"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wine fridge or cabinet": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cave à vin ou armoire"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wine fridge, 24": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cave à vin, 24"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wine merchant": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Caviste"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wine not found": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vin introuvable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wine or note": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vin ou note"
          }
        }
